Docker CLI path-resolution failure — no container/verifier invocation.

The first launch command ran from the parent task workspace instead of this experiment worktree. PowerShell could not resolve the relative study path, so Docker received an empty bind-mount source and exited 125 with `invalid value for 'source': value is empty` before creating a container. The formal scratch directory was created but remained empty. No source, #4447 evidence, or verifier was mounted/read. A later command used validated absolute paths; the one successful container/verifier invocation and its result are recorded in OUTER_RUN.json and CONTROL_RESULTS.json.
